Stray closing delimiters with no opener: an extra ')' after a value, an
extra '}' after an array literal, and an extra ']' after a subscript.
Each should be one unmatched_delimiter finding, without cascading into
the statements that follow.
-- input.ssl --
:DECLARE aItems, nFirst;
nFirst := 1);
aItems := {1, 2, 3}};
nFirst := aItems[1]];
:RETURN nFirst;
-- format --
:DECLARE aItems, nFirst;

nFirst := 1);
aItems := {1, 2, 3}};
nFirst := aItems[1]];

:RETURN nFirst;
-- diagnostics --
2:12-2:13 error unmatched_delimiter: Unmatched ')'
3:20-3:21 error unmatched_delimiter: Unmatched '}'
4:20-4:21 error unmatched_delimiter: Unmatched ']'
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
2:12-2:13 error unmatched_delimiter: Unmatched ')'
3:20-3:21 error unmatched_delimiter: Unmatched '}'
4:20-4:21 error unmatched_delimiter: Unmatched ']'
